---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../../components/Hero.astro';
import Section from '../../components/Section.astro';
import Figure from '../../components/Figure.astro';
import lightShow from '../../assets/photos/light-show-crowd.jpg';
import { ORG } from '../../consts';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Lanterns of Hope"
  description="The Sylvan Ramble light show is coming back as Lanterns of Hope — a holiday fundraiser where sponsored lanterns fund storm recovery."
>
  <Hero
    eyebrow="In development"
    title="Lanterns of Hope"
    lede="The light show is coming back. This time the lights pay for hotel rooms in October."
  />

  <Section title="What it was">
    <p class="intro">
      From 2015 to 2023, a front yard on Sylvan Ramble Street in South Tampa ran
      one of the largest synchronized light shows in the region — thousands of
      individually controllable lights, flame effects, water, smoke, all
      choreographed to music across a twenty-minute show, for Halloween and again
      at Christmas.
    </p>
    <Figure
      src={lightShow}
      alt="Neighbours gathered in the street watching the Sylvan Ramble Lights display, the house behind them lit in green and purple."
      caption="A typical night on Sylvan Ramble Street."
      priority={true}
    />
    <ul class="totals">
      <li><strong>20,000+</strong><span>visitors across the show's lifetime</span></li>
      <li><strong>~$50,000</strong><span>raised for local charities</span></li>
      <li><strong>500+</strong><span>people on peak nights</span></li>
      <li><strong>NBC</strong><span>Nightly News coverage</span></li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Every dollar went to other organizations — including Clothes To Kids, who
      turned more than $9,000 into over 180 weekly wardrobes for children, and
      Where Love Grows, who received $9,014.45 toward fighting child hunger.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/about/press">The press coverage &rarr;</a></p>
  </Section>

  <Section tone="surface" title="What people said">
    <div class="quotes">
      <blockquote>
        <p>We have been bringing our little boy since he was 3 and he asks every year. You make the holidays special for so many.</p>
        <cite>Neil and Kim Lamis</cite>
      </blockquote>
      <blockquote>
        <p>Ingenious! Best and most creative light show. Extremely well organized. Handicap welcomed. Great for the young and the older audience.</p>
        <cite>Google review</cite>
      </blockquote>
      <blockquote>
        <p>This became a family tradition of ours for years. So thankful for the show, donations and good spirits!</p>
        <cite>Michelle Leigh</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section title="What it's becoming">
    <p class="intro">
      Lanterns of Hope takes the same idea and points it at our own work: a
      holiday display where <strong>sponsored lanterns</strong> light the way and
      fund storm recovery for Florida families.
    </p>
    <p>
      The show outgrew a residential street, so this one needs a venue, sponsors,
      and a crew. If you want a hand in bringing it back — as a host site, a
      sponsor, or a volunteer who knows their way around a controller — now is
      the moment to say so.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a class="btn" href={`mailto:${ORG.email}?subject=Lanterns%20of%20Hope`}>Help bring it back</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/give/volunteer">Volunteer</a>
    </p>
  </Section>

  <Section tone="surface" title="Be told first">
    <p>
      If you came to the light show and want to know when it returns, we'll write
      to you — and only about this, unless you tell us otherwise.
    </p>
    <p><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/contact">Join the list</a></p>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .intro { font-size: var(--step-1); }
  .totals { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: var(--space-md) 0; display: grid; gap: var(--space-md); grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(170px, 100%), 1fr)); }
  .totals li { border-top: 3px solid var(--color-accent); padding-top: var(--space-sm); }
  .totals strong { display: block; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--step-2); line-height: 1; }
  .totals span { display: block; margin-top: 0.3rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: var(--step--1); }
  .quotes { display: grid; gap: var(--space-md); grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(260px, 100%), 1fr)); margin-top: var(--space-md); }
  blockquote { margin: 0; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent); padding-left: var(--space-sm); }
  blockquote p { font-style: italic; }
  cite { font-size: var(--step--1); color: var(--color-text-muted); font-style: normal; }
</style>
